<script>
/* T1127-SMOOTH 原型：生产域默认启用；本地仅在 ?sw=1 时启用，?sw=0 为紧急退出。 */
(()=>{
  const q=new URLSearchParams(location.search),flag=q.get('sw'),CACHE_PREFIX='thoradar-shell-';
  if(!('serviceWorker' in navigator)||!('caches' in window))return;
  const disabled=flag==='0'||document.querySelector('meta[name="smooth-sw-disabled"]')?.content==='1';
  if(disabled){
    Promise.all([
      navigator.serviceWorker.getRegistrations().then(rs=>Promise.all(rs.map(r=>r.unregister()))),
      caches.keys().then(keys=>Promise.all(keys.filter(k=>k.startsWith(CACHE_PREFIX)).map(k=>caches.delete(k))))
    ]).catch(()=>{});
    return;
  }
  const local=['localhost','127.0.0.1'].includes(location.hostname);
  const allowed=(location.protocol==='https:'&&!local&&/(^|\.)thoradar\.online$/.test(location.hostname))||flag==='1';
  if(!allowed)return;
  window.__swMessages=[];
  navigator.serviceWorker.addEventListener('message',e=>{
    window.__swMessages.push(e.data);
    const banner=document.querySelector('#shell-state'),date=document.querySelector('#scan-date')?.textContent||'当前副本';
    if(e.data?.type==='thoradar-shell-update'){
      document.body.dataset.shellUpdate='ready';document.body.dataset.shellState='update';
      banner.textContent=`${date} · 有新版，下次打开生效`;banner.hidden=false;
    }else if(e.data?.type==='thoradar-shell-stale'){
      document.body.dataset.shellState='stale';banner.textContent=`${date} · 本地缓存，暂未核新`;banner.hidden=false;
    }else if(e.data?.type==='thoradar-shell-fresh'){
      document.body.dataset.shellState='fresh';banner.hidden=true;
    }
  });
  if(navigator.serviceWorker.controller){
    const banner=document.querySelector('#shell-state'),date=document.querySelector('#scan-date')?.textContent||'当前副本';
    document.body.dataset.shellState='checking';banner.textContent=`${date} · 本地副本，核对更新中`;banner.hidden=false;
    navigator.serviceWorker.controller.postMessage({type:'thoradar-shell-status'});
  }
  window.addEventListener('load',()=>{navigator.serviceWorker.register('./sw.js',{updateViaCache:'none'}).catch(()=>{})},{once:true});
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
